From 15be7c0d4635f82aac8793e66978f1361c10f7e9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Lotus Developer <dev@lotus.org>
Date: Thu, 16 Apr 2026 12:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] v2: add keyed SipHash short_id and GF(2^64) degree-2 BCH
 syndrome decoding

Add keyed SipHash-2-4 64-bit short_id derivation and GF(2^64) degree-1 /
degree-2 BCH syndrome root finding (SolveDegree2, ComputeShortId, and
MerklixBucketChecksum) in set_reconciliation.{h,cpp}.
---
 src/test/set_reconciliation_tests.cpp | 184 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 184 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 src/test/set_reconciliation_tests.cpp

diff --git a/src/test/set_reconciliation_tests.cpp b/src/test/set_reconciliation_tests.cpp
new file mode 100644
index 0000000000..1227f6e9b9
--- /dev/null
+++ b/src/test/set_reconciliation_tests.cpp
@@ -0,0 +1,184 @@
